# This repo's Vercel project ("farsh-e-zameen-backend") has its Root
# Directory set to "backend" — only backend/ is actually deployed. Everything
# else here (the Expo app, its node_modules, native build output) has no
# business being uploaded to a Vercel deploy, so exclude it explicitly.
node_modules/
android/
ios/
.expo/
.expo-shared/
dist/
web-build/
*.apk
*.aab
*.jks
.git/
.idea/
.vscode/
